WEBVTT

00:05:30.326 --> 00:05:31.327
(Laughter)

00:05:31.327 --> 00:05:32.328
(Applause and cheers)

00:05:33.788 --> 00:05:36.457
Settling is very insidious.

00:05:36.624 --> 00:05:38.959
It keeps us dancing on this string,

00:05:38.959 --> 00:05:42.421
waiting for this elusive, better day
to miraculously appear.

00:05:43.214 --> 00:05:46.467
Now thanks to Lolly’s tutelage,
that’s not my story.

00:05:47.093 --> 00:05:49.512
In fact, I take each day as it comes

00:05:49.512 --> 00:05:51.514
but I try to make it better than the last.

00:05:51.514 --> 00:05:54.225
So, you know, I’m single ...

00:05:54.225 --> 00:05:56.310
but I’m always ready to mingle.

00:05:56.685 --> 00:05:57.686
(Laughter)

00:05:58.896 --> 00:06:00.689
I’m an entrepreneur,